        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "e) The Board shall establish in FY 94 a point of service (POS) health plan that shall be offered to all unit members on a voluntary basis. The Board shall pay 90% of the annual premium for each unit member enrolled in said plan and the unit member shall pay 10% of the annual premium for said plan.",
            "block_bbox": [
                109,
                172,
